{"4048550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Diner Simulator 🥩 💀", "steam_appid": 4048550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "The apocalypse is over. The dead are hungry. And you're running the only diner in town.<br><br>Welcome to Zombie Diner, a unique blend of diner management, survival, and gruesome gastronomy. In a world where civilization has collapsed, the undead have developed a taste for the finer things in undeath—namely, expertly prepared human cuisine. You're the chef, and business is booming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/618ba972126ab454cdef8433c97ed1be.poster.avif?t=1765645209\" width=828 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/618ba972126ab454cdef8433c97ed1be.webm?t=1765645209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/618ba972126ab454cdef8433c97ed1be.mp4?t=1765645209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Order fresh ingredients (sourced in questionable ways), manage your pantry, and craft a menu of horrifyingly delicious meals. From &quot;Brain Tacos&quot; to &quot;Sloppy Joes,&quot; every dish needs precision and a steady hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/bbafa13bd1e5ea3866be2ecaf260a4e5.poster.avif?t=1765645209\" width=828 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/bbafa13bd1e5ea3866be2ecaf260a4e5.webm?t=1765645209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/bbafa13bd1e5ea3866be2ecaf260a4e5.mp4?t=1765645209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When the sun goes down, the customers crawl out. Take orders from your discerning zombie clientele and serve them quickly before their patience (and your reputation) runs out. The faster you are, the more money you'll earn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/ee17e29ae1d2f9089b0f4dea96756cb0.poster.avif?t=1765645209\" width=828 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/ee17e29ae1d2f9089b0f4dea96756cb0.webm?t=1765645209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/ee17e29ae1d2f9089b0f4dea96756cb0.mp4?t=1765645209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Not every customer is a five-star patron. If a zombie's hunger timer runs out, they'll forget their manners and come for your brains instead of your food. Grab your trusty shotgun and defend your livelihood in a frantic, life-or-death struggle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/711a7ffd55c0c9b30f365f93b2199522.avif?t=1765645209\" width=800 height=389 /></span>", "about_the_game": "The apocalypse is over. The dead are hungry. And you're running the only diner in town.<br><br>Welcome to Zombie Diner, a unique blend of diner management, survival, and gruesome gastronomy. In a world where civilization has collapsed, the undead have developed a taste for the finer things in undeath—namely, expertly prepared human cuisine. You're the chef, and business is booming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/618ba972126ab454cdef8